              "id": "19cda324",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#999;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;margin-bottom:24px;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE — e.g. 1 June 2026]</strong></p>\n<p>In compliance with the <strong>Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</strong>, Burans Valley has appointed a Grievance Officer to address all customer complaints.</p>\n\n<div style=\"background:#F2F5F2;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;border-left:4px solid #D4AF37;border-radius:6px;padding:28px 32px;margin:28px 0;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;margin-top:0;\">Grievance Officer Details</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;width:38%;color:#555;font-weight:600;\">Name</td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\"><strong>[GRIEVANCE OFFICER FULL NAME]</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;font-weight:600;\">Designation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\">[e.g. Founder / Customer Experience Head]</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;font-weight:600;\">Email</td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\"><a href=\"mailto:[GRIEVANCE EMAIL]\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">[GRIEVANCE EMAIL]</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;font-weight:600;\">Phone / WhatsApp</td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\">[PHONE] (Mon–Sat, 10am–6pm IST)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;color:#555;font-weight:600;\">Address</td><td style=\"padding:8px 4px;\">[FULL REGISTERED ADDRESS, UTTARAKHAND]</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">How to File a Grievance</h2>\n<ol><li>Email <strong>[GRIEVANCE EMAIL]</strong> with subject: <em>\"Customer Grievance — [Your Order ID]\"</em>.</li><li>Include: your name, registered contact, Order ID, description of the issue, and any photos/documents.</li><li>We will <strong>acknowledge your complaint within 48 hours</strong>.</li><li>We aim to <strong>resolve all complaints within 30 days</strong>. Complex cases may take longer — you will be kept informed.</li></ol>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">Escalation</h2>\n<p>If unresolved after 30 days, escalate to the <strong>National Consumer Disputes Redressal Commission (NCDRC)</strong> or the relevant State Consumer Forum under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019. Also available: Government Consumer Helpline at <a href=\"https://consumerhelpline.gov.in\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">consumerhelpline.gov.in</a> or 1800-11-4000.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">Related Policies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/return-refund-policy\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a> — order complaints</li>\n<li><a href=\"/privacy-policy\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Privacy Policy</a> — data complaints</li>\n<li><a href=\"/terms-conditions\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> — contractual matters</li>\n</ul>\n",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
